STRESS BAD single #4 1031x640: ink at 0.5,0.5 is [0, 0, 0, 0], want [22, 217, 113]
STRESS BAD single #16 646x977: ink at 0.5,0.5 is [0, 0, 0, 0], want [22, 48, 217]
STRESS BAD single #24 713x873: ink at 0.5,0.5 is [22, 217, 57, 255], want [22, 217, 178]
